      "explore_probability_through_experiment": "Chunguza uwezekano kupitia majaribio. Endesha majaribio na uone masafa yaliyozingatiwa yakikaribia maadili yanayotarajiwa.",
      "coin_the_simplest_50_50": "Sarafu — 50/50 rahisi zaidi",
      "p_h_p_t_0_5_law_of_large_numbers_as_tr": "P(H) = P(T) = 0.5. Sheria ya idadi kubwa: kadiri majaribio yanavyoongezeka, uwiano wa kichwa unakaribia 0.5. Baada ya kurusha mara 1,000 utakuwa ndani ya ~3% ya 50%, lakini katika mfululizo wowote mfupi chochote kinawezekana.",
      "dice_uniform_1_n_each_d4_d6_d8_d10_d12": "Dadu — kila moja sawa 1/N (d4 / d6 / d8 / d10 / d12 / d20)",
      "pick_any_die_size_each_face_equally_li": "Chagua ukubwa wowote wa dadu. Kila uso unawezekana sawa: P = 1/N. Hisabati ni sawa katika aina zote za dadu — kinachobadilika ni denominator. d4 ni 1/4, d20 ni 1/20.",
