      "pilot_receipt_snow_infiltration": "Kupenya ardhini",
      "pilot_receipt_snow_infiltration_cause": "Maji ya theluji iliyorundikana yaliingia kwenye matundu yaliyounganishwa ya udongo unaopenyeza na yakahamia hifadhi ya chini ya uso.",
      "pilot_receipt_snow_plant_uptake": "Ufyonzwaji na mimea",
