      "quiz_912_8_opt4": "Uwiano wa mawingu na anga safi",
      "quiz_912_8_q": "Uwiano wa Bowen ni nini?",
      "quiz_k2_1_fb1": "Ingawa maji kiasi hupenya ardhini, madimbwi yaliyo juu ya vijia na barabara mara nyingi hutoweka kwa sababu jua huyapasha hadi kuwa mvuke.",
      "quiz_k2_1_fb3": "Upepo unaweza kusaidia maji kuvukiza haraka kwa kusogeza hewa, lakini joto la jua ndilo sababu kuu ya maji ya majimaji kubadilika kuwa gesi.",
      "quiz_k2_1_fb4": "Molekuli za maji hazilali kamwe! Nishati ya jua huzifanya zisogee kwa kasi zaidi na kuelea juu angani.",
      "quiz_k2_1_opt1": "Ardhi huyanywa",
      "quiz_k2_1_opt2": "Jua huyapasha maji",
      "quiz_k2_1_opt3": "Upepo huyapeperusha",
      "quiz_k2_1_opt4": "Huenda kulala",
      "quiz_k2_1_q": "Ni nini kinachofanya madimbwi yatoweke katika siku za jua?",
      "quiz_k2_2_fb1": "Mawingu yanaonekana laini kama pamba, lakini kwa kweli yametengenezwa na mabilioni ya matone madogo ya maji yanayoelea hewani.",
      "quiz_k2_2_fb3": "Moshi hutoka kwenye moto, lakini mawingu ya angani yametengenezwa na matone safi ya maji na vioo vya barafu.",
      "quiz_k2_2_fb4": "Viputo vya hewa hunaswa ndani ya maji, lakini mawingu ni matone ya maji yaliyonaswa hewani!",
      "quiz_k2_2_opt1": "Pamba",
      "quiz_k2_2_opt2": "Matone madogo ya maji",
      "quiz_k2_2_opt3": "Moshi",
      "quiz_k2_2_opt4": "Viputo vya hewa",
      "quiz_k2_2_q": "Mawingu yametengenezwa na nini?",
      "quiz_k2_3_fb1": "Nyota ni majua makubwa yanayowaka mbali angani. Hayaangushwi na mawingu!",
      "quiz_k2_3_fb3": "Majani huanguka kutoka miti wakati wa msimu wa kupukutika, si kutoka mawingu ya angani.",
      "quiz_k2_3_fb4": "Mawe ni sehemu nzito za ardhi. Ni maji ya majimaji au yaliyoganda tu ndiyo yanayoanguka kutoka mawinguni.",
      "quiz_k2_3_opt1": "Nyota",
      "quiz_k2_3_opt2": "Mvua na theluji",
      "quiz_k2_3_opt3": "Majani",
      "quiz_k2_3_opt4": "Mawe",
      "quiz_k2_3_q": "Ni nini kinachoanguka kutoka mawinguni?",
      "quiz_k2_4_fb1": "Maji hayapotei! Hukusanyika katika maziwa, hutiririka mitoni na hujaza bahari.",
      "quiz_k2_4_fb2": "Mvua lazima ikusanyike ardhini kwanza kabla jua halijaipasha ili ipande tena baadaye.",
      "quiz_k2_4_fb4": "Nguvu ya uvutano ya Dunia hushikilia maji kwenye sayari yetu. Hukusanyika baharini na maziwani badala ya kutoroka angani.",
      "quiz_k2_4_opt1": "Hutoweka",
      "quiz_k2_4_opt2": "Hurudi juu angani",
      "quiz_k2_4_opt3": "Mitoni, maziwani na baharini",
      "quiz_k2_4_opt4": "Nje ya anga la dunia",
      "quiz_k2_4_q": "Mvua huenda wapi baada ya kunyesha?",
      "quiz_k2_5_fb1": "Majani yanaweza kufyonza unyevu kidogo sana, lakini mimea hupata karibu maji yake yote kwa kuyanywa kutoka udongoni kupitia mizizi.",
      "quiz_k2_5_fb3": "Maua huvutia nyuki na kutengeneza mbegu, lakini hayanywi maji kutoka udongoni.",
      "quiz_k2_5_fb4": "Viumbe vyote hai vinahitaji maji ili kuishi, mimea ikiwemo!",
      "quiz_k2_5_opt1": "Kupitia majani yake",
      "quiz_k2_5_opt2": "Kupitia mizizi yake",
      "quiz_k2_5_opt3": "Kupitia maua yake",
      "quiz_k2_5_opt4": "Haynywi maji",
      "quiz_k2_5_q": "Mimea hunywaje maji?",
      "quiz_k2_6_fb1": "Jua hutoa joto, ambalo hupasha maji badala ya kuyaganda kuwa barafu.",
      "quiz_k2_6_fb3": "Mwani na mimea vinaweza kufanya maji yaonekane ya kijani, lakini jua huyapasha ili yavukize.",
      "quiz_k2_6_fb4": "Maji ya bahari tayari yana chumvi kwa sababu ya madini yaliyoyeyuka, si kwa sababu ya jua.",
      "quiz_k2_6_opt1": "Huyaganda",
      "quiz_k2_6_opt2": "Huyapasha hadi yapande kama mvuke",
      "quiz_k2_6_opt3": "Huyafanya ya kijani",
      "quiz_k2_6_opt4": "Huyafanya ya chumvi",
      "quiz_k2_6_q": "Jua hufanya nini kwa maji ya bahari?",
      "quiz_k2_7_fb2": "Nyota ni miili mikubwa iliyo angani, ilhali mvuke wa maji hugandisha tu na kuwa matone ya wingu.",
      "quiz_k2_7_fb3": "Gesi ya mvuke wa maji haionekani, lakini inapopoa na kugandisha, huwa matone ya majimaji yanayoonekana (mawingu).",
      "quiz_k2_7_fb4": "Maji hayawaki moto! Mvuke unaopoa hurudi kuwa maji ya majimaji.",
      "quiz_k2_7_opt1": "Hubadilika kuwa matone ya wingu",
      "quiz_k2_7_opt2": "Huwa nyota",
      "quiz_k2_7_opt3": "Hubaki hauonekani",
      "quiz_k2_7_opt4": "Huwaka moto",
      "quiz_k2_7_q": "Ni nini hutokea mvuke wa maji unapopoa juu angani?",
      "quiz_k2_8_fb1": "Maji ya ardhini ni sehemu ya mzunguko. Hutiririka polepole na kutokeza kwenye chemchemi za asili au kuvutwa juu kupitia visima.",
      "quiz_k2_8_fb3": "Visima vilivyochimbwa hufikia maji ya ardhini, lakini chemchemi za asili hububujika juu bila kuchimba kokote.",
      "quiz_k2_8_fb4": "Chemchemi hutiririka bila kukoma, hata siku za jua, kwa sababu maji ya ardhini husogea polepole sana.",
      "quiz_k2_8_opt1": "Hapana, kamwe",
