      "remember_p_a_s_s_pull_the_pin_aim_at_b": "Kumbuka P.A.S.S.: Pull (Vuta pini), Aim (Lenga chini ya moto), Squeeze (Bonyeza mpini), Sweep (Fagia upande mmoja hadi mwingine). Asidi ya acetic na baadhi ya viyeyusho huwaka — jua eneo hili kabla ya kuanza.",
      "safety_data_sheets_located": "📋 Karatasi za data ya usalama zimepatikana!",
