      "all_cards": "Kadi zote:",
      "cards_are_designed_to_be_printed_and_u": "💡 Kadi zimebuniwa kuchapishwa na kutumika mbali na skrini. Vifaa halisi vya kimwili bado hushinda vya kidijitali kwa K-2 — mzunguko wa kugusa ni muhimu. ",
      "the_app_gives_you_every_manipulative_o": "Programu inakupa KILA kifaa mkononi, hata wakati sanduku halisi haliko chumbani.",
      "faq": "❓ Maswali",
      "shortcuts": "⌨ Njia za mkato",
