      "drag_across_strings_to_strum": "Buruta kwenye nyuzi ili ku-strum!",
      "fm_synthesis_controls": "🌟 Vidhibiti vya Usanisi wa FM",
      "fm_synthesis_2": "Usanisi wa FM",
      "frequency_modulation_fm_synthesis_uses": "Usanisi wa Frequency Modulation (FM) hutumia oscillator moja (modulator) kubadilisha masafa ya nyingine (carrier) kwa haraka. Uwiano wa modulator:carrier huamua maudhui ya harmonic. Uwiano rahisi (1:1, 2:1, 3:1) huzalisha toni za harmonic. Uwiano tata huzalisha sauti za kimadini, kama kengele, au zisizo za harmonic. FM ilijulikana kwa Yamaha DX7 mwaka 1983.",
      "bright": "Angavu",
      "fm_mod_depth": "Kina cha modulation ya FM",
      "pure": "Safi",
      "metallic": "Kimadini",
      "supersaw_controls": "⚡ Vidhibiti vya SuperSaw",
      "supersaw_unison": "SuperSaw / Unison",
      "supersaw_stacks_multiple_sawtooth_osci": "SuperSaw hupanga oscillator nyingi za sawtooth zilizopotoshwa kidogo kutoka kwa nyingine. Hii huunda sauti kubwa, pana, inayong'aa — alama ya EDM, trance, na pop ya kisasa. Sauti zaidi = nene zaidi lakini hutumia CPU zaidi. Detuning hudhibiti umbali wa vipatanishi vya sauti — detune zaidi = pana/kama chorus zaidi, kidogo = imara/iliyolenga zaidi.",
      "supersaw_voice_count": "Idadi ya sauti za supersaw",
