      "filter_type": "Aina ya kichujio",
      "modulation": "✨ Modulation",
      "chord_progressions": "🎶 Mfuatano wa Kodi",
      "play_progression": "Cheza Mfuatano",
      "arpeggiator": "🌀 Arpeggiator",
      "pattern": "Mfumo",
      "pattern_2": "Mfumo",
      "rate": "Kasi",
      "arpeggiator_rate": "Kasi ya arpeggiator",
      "gate": "Gate",
      "arpeggiator_gate": "Gate ya arpeggiator",
      "an_arpeggiator_plays_the_notes_of_a_ch": "🔬 Arpeggiator hucheza noti za kodi moja baada ya nyingine kwa mfuatano. \"Juu\" huenda chini kwenda juu, ikiunda nishati inayopanda. \"Chini\" hushuka kwa hisia ya maporomoko. Kasi hudhibiti mwendo (chini = haraka zaidi). Gate hudhibiti muda kila noti inavyolia (100% = legato, 10% = staccato). Jaribu kasi=100ms + oktava 4 + mfumo wa juu kwa arpeggio ya trance ya kawaida!",
      "live_mic_effects_lab": "🎤 Maabara ya Athari za Maikrofoni Moja kwa Moja",
      "sing_speak_or_play_an_instrument_hear_": "Imba, zungumza, au cheza ala — sikia athari kwa wakati halisi!",
      "monitor_hear_yourself_use_headphones": "🔊 Monitor (jisikie mwenyewe — tumia vipokea sauti vya kichwa!)",
      "microphone_monitor_volume": "Sauti ya monitor ya maikrofoni",
      "how_effects_change_sound_waves": "🔬 Jinsi Athari Zinavyobadilisha Mawimbi ya Sauti",
      "filter_cutoff": "Kichujio (Cutoff)",
      "removes_frequencies_above_lowpass_or_b": "Huondoa masafa yaliyo juu (lowpass) au chini (highpass) ya kizingiti. Kama kufunika mdomo kwa mkono — masafa ya juu hupotea, sauti inakuwa \"nyeusi\" zaidi.",
      "delay": "Delay",
      "creates_echoes_by_copying_the_signal_a": "Huunda mwangwi kwa kunakili ishara na kuicheza tena baada ya muda mfupi. Feedback hudhibiti idadi ya mwangwi unaorudiwa.",
      "reverb_2": "Reverb",
      "simulates_room_acoustics_by_creating_t": "Huiga acoustics ya chumba kwa kuunda maelfu ya mwangwi midogo inayochanganyika pamoja. Chumba kidogo = reverb fupi, kanisa kuu = reverb ndefu.",
      "distortion": "Distortion",
      "clips_the_waveform_peaks_turning_smoot": "Hukata vilele vya waveform, ikigeuza mawimbi laini ya sine kuwa maumbo makali, yenye pembe. Hii huongeza harmonics mpya ambazo hazikuwepo kwenye sauti asili.",
      "chorus": "Chorus",
      "duplicates_the_signal_with_a_slight_co": "Hunakili ishara kwa delay ndogo inayobadilika mfululizo. Hii huiga sauti/ala nyingi zinazocheza pamoja bila kupatana kidogo.",
      "tremolo": "Tremolo",
      "rapidly_varies_the_volume_up_and_down_": "Hubadilisha sauti juu na chini kwa haraka, ikiunda athari ya kupwita. Ni ya kawaida kwenye gitaa la surf na muziki wa organ.",
      "use_headphones_when_monitoring_to_avoi": "Tumia vipokea sauti vya kichwa unapofuatilia ili kuepuka vitanzi vya feedback! Maikrofoni hupitia athari zote hapo juu (kichujio, delay, reverb, n.k.) — zirekebishe ili kusikia jinsi kila moja inavyobadilisha sauti au ala yako.",
      "connect_your_microphone_to_run_your_vo": "Unganisha maikrofoni yako ili kupitisha sauti au ala yako kwenye mnyororo wa athari kwa wakati halisi.",
      "see_your_voice_as_a_waveform_frequency": "Ona sauti yako kama waveform + spectrum ya masafa. Sikia jinsi kichujio, delay, reverb, distortion, na chorus zinavyobadilisha mawimbi ya sauti kimwili.",
      "xy_performance_pad": "🎯 Pedi ya Utendaji ya XY",
      "touch_drag_x_pitch_y_filter_effect": "Gusa na buruta — X = pitch, Y = kichujio/athari",
      "xy_pad_performance": "Utendaji wa Pedi ya XY",
      "the_xy_pad_maps_your_finger_mouse_posi": "Pedi ya XY huchora nafasi ya kidole/kipanya chako kwenye vigezo vya muziki kwa wakati halisi. Mhimili wa X hudhibiti pitch (kushoto = chini, kulia = juu). Mhimili wa Y hudhibiti masafa ya cutoff ya kichujio (juu = angavu, chini = nyeusi). Hii ni sawa na ala kama Korg Kaoss Pad, iliyobadilisha utendaji wa muziki wa kielektroniki wa moja kwa moja kwa kugeuza ishara za 2D kuwa sauti.",
      "xy_performance_pad_left_right_is_pitch": "Pedi ya utendaji ya XY. Kushoto–kulia ni pitch, juu–chini ni mng'ao wa kichujio. Tumia vitufe vya mishale kusogea na kucheza noti; bonyeza Escape au Space kusimamisha.",
