      "starfish_5_fold_snowflakes_6_fold_and_": ", nyota za bahari (mara 5), vipande vya theluji (mara 6), na maua huonyesha hili kila mahali.",
      "tile_patterns_quilts_floor_mosaics": " Mifumo ya vigae, mashuka ya vipande, mozaiki za sakafu. ",
