      "a_bird_s_bill_tells_you_what_it_eats_i": "A bird's bill tells you what it eats. Its feet tell you where it lives. Look at any bird and you can read its lifestyle from those two parts alone — without ever seeing it eat or move. This module shows the eight common bill shapes and six common foot patterns, and which species in BirdLab's habitats use each.",
      "a_bird_s_body_is_shaped_to_fit_a_speci": "A bird's body is shaped to fit a specific habitat — feet, bill, body shape, behavior. Once you know a species' habitat, you can predict where to look for it. Once you know a habitat, you can predict which species you'll find there. Real birders use both directions of this reasoning.",
