      "species_selected_the_sonar_simulator_b": "Species selected! The sonar simulator below is now configured for your bat.",
      "speed_frequency_times_wavelength_in_ai": "Speed = frequency times wavelength. In air at 20°C, v = 343 m/s.",
      "speed_of_sound_calculator": "Speed of Sound Calculator",
