      "fatty_fish_salmon_sardines_herring_egg": "Fatty fish (salmon, sardines, herring), egg yolks, fortified milk and plant milks, fortified cereals. Many Mainers benefit from a winter vitamin D supplement — but dose should be guided by a blood test (ask your doctor for a 25-hydroxy vitamin D test). Don't guess.",
