      "nutrition_science_as_it_actually_plays": "Nutrition science as it actually plays out in Maine",
      "nutrition_science_from_a_physiology_fi": "Nutrition science from a physiology-first lens. What your body uses food for, why micronutrients matter, how to read a label, and the careers built on this knowledge. No calorie targets, no good/bad food binaries — just real biology.",
      "nutritionist_vs_registered_dietitian_n": "⚠ \"Nutritionist\" vs \"Registered Dietitian Nutritionist\"",
