      "sheets_are_hung_individually_in_a_loft": "Sheets are hung individually in a loft to air-dry for days. Then dipped in animal-glue sizing (made from boiled bone/hide scraps) to make paper non-absorbent enough for writing/printing. Final pressing + finishing produces the marketable sheet.",
      "sheets_needed": "Sheets needed",
