      "a_car_behind_you_appears_in_the_rearvi": "A car behind you appears in the rearview mirror first. As it moves to pass, it enters the side mirror BEFORE it leaves the rearview. As it leaves the side mirror, it enters your peripheral vision. No gap = no blind spot.",
