      "pool_drain_entrapment_is_rare_but_cata": "Pool drain entrapment is rare but catastrophic. A pool pump can generate suction strong enough to hold an adult underwater. Federal law has specific requirements for drain covers since 2008, but old pools, broken covers, and home pools may not be compliant. This module teaches what to look for and what to do.",
      "pool_drain_risks": "Pool Drain Risks",
      "pool_fences_with_self_closing_self_lat": "Pool fences with self-closing, self-latching gates (height per local code, typically 4 ft minimum). Door alarms on every door leading outside. Pool covers when not in use. For at-risk students, additional gate locks at heights beyond the child's reach.",
